    "description": "<p>Sapiren Testaments contain names, diagrams, nested questions and passages whose grammar resembles lists of observations rather than conventional scripture. Their markings often cluster around the brow, eyes and hands.</p>\n<p>Sapiren tend to be curious, analytical and dissatisfied with unsupported certainty. Many accumulate specialist interests with remarkable intensity, surrounding themselves with notes, specimens and unfinished investigations. They have a reputation for answering a simple question with three better questions, a habit other Kethrani find either admirable or exhausting.<br>You gain an additional +1 racial bonus to Intelligence and may select any one Lore specialist skill.</p>",
